-- תקנון שירות עובדי הוראה, פרק 2, §2.11 גננת בחטיבה צעירה
-- A kindergarten teacher in a young division attached to a first or second
-- grade: the rate of her education allowance, and from when.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `2.11 גננת בחטיבה צעירה`

GIVEN d IS A DATE, e IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE d `is on or after` e IF
    DATE_SERIAL d AT LEAST DATE_SERIAL e

@desc The grade the young division's kindergarten is attached to (הצמודה לכיתה א' / ב').
DECLARE `attached grade` IS ONE OF `first grade`, `second grade`

-- akn:chp_2__sec_2_11__hc_2 The section's title line.
-- akn:chp_2__sec_2_11__hc_2/p1 An amendment note: updated 21.7.02.

-- 1: the young-division teacher attached to a first grade: an education
-- allowance of 11.5%.
@ref akn:chp_2__sec_2_11__hc_2__para_1
`the education allowance beside a first grade` MEANS 11.5%

-- 2: attached to a second grade: an education allowance of 10%.
@ref akn:chp_2__sec_2_11__hc_2__para_2
`the education allowance beside a second grade` MEANS 10%

-- "תחולה: 1.9.01". The corpus nests it under 2, but it closes the list and
-- is read as dating both rates.
@ref akn:chp_2__sec_2_11__hc_2__para_2/p2
`the young-division rates apply from` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2001

-- akn:chp_2__sec_2_11__hc_3 The heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_2__sec_2_11__hc_3__para_1 A source: joint decision of the Ministries of Education and Finance of 6.3.01; special collective agreement of 10.7.02.

§§ `The allowance`

-- The text gives the allowance as a percentage and does not name its base;
-- section 1.12 (¶20 and ¶23 of its rows) computes every role allowance as a
-- percentage of one base, which is taken here as an input. Before 1.9.2001
-- section 2.11 gives no allowance: the 0 says that, not that none is owed
-- under another section.
GIVEN g IS AN `attached grade`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `young-division education allowance rate` g IS
    CONSIDER g
    WHEN `first grade`  THEN `the education allowance beside a first grade`
    WHEN `second grade` THEN `the education allowance beside a second grade`

@export default The monthly education allowance of a young-division kindergarten teacher under section 2.11 of the takanon
GIVEN g IS AN `attached grade` @desc the grade her kindergarten is attached to
      d IS A DATE @desc any day of the month paid
      `allowances' base` IS A NUMBER @desc the base section 1.12 computes role allowances on (its ¶20: the combined salary by grade and seniority with the 3%, 5%, 4% and 1994 supplements, for one full position); an input
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `young-division education allowance` g d `allowances' base` IS
    IF d `is on or after` `the young-division rates apply from`
    THEN `allowances' base` TIMES `young-division education allowance rate` g
    ELSE 0

-- Worked examples; the base of 10,000 is a placeholder.
#ASSERT `young-division education allowance` `first grade` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 10 2002) 10000 EQUALS 1150
#ASSERT `young-division education allowance` `second grade` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 10 2002) 10000 EQUALS 1000
#ASSERT `young-division education allowance` `first grade` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 8 2001) 10000 EQUALS 0
